        "name": "Harsh Motivator",
        "slug": "harsh-motivator",
        "description": "<p>Trigger: The user applied @Affliction[bleed] to a targeted Ally.</p><p>Effect: The creature takes damage up to @Tick[-8] and cannot drop below 5 Ticks’ worth of HP from this Action. The creature is cured of @Affliction[bleed], and gains @Affliction[resolved 3], @Affliction[hale 3], and @Affliction[chanted 3].</p>",
        "traits": [
          "interrupt-3",
          "flinch-30"
        ],
        "type": "generic",
        "img": "systems/ptr2e/img/perk-icons/Taskmaster.svg",
        "cost": {
          "activation": "free",
          "powerPoints": 2
        },
        "range": {
          "target": "ally",
          "unit": "m"
        }
      }
    ],
    "description": "<p>If the user applies @Affliction[bleed] to an Ally, they can spend 2 PP as a Free Action at @Trait[interrupt 3] and @Trait[flinch 30] to cause that ally to lose up to @Tick[-8] (unable to drop below 5 Ticks’ worth of HP) — curing them of @Affliction[bleed] and granting @Affliction[resolved 3], @Affliction[hale 3], and @Affliction[chanted 3].</p><blockquote><p>Note: Please ensure you have the target ally's out-of-character consent to use this perk on them, if pertinent.</p></blockquote><p>The user’s @Trait[impel] Attacks are resisted an additional step by Allied targets.</p>",
